'''September Gauntlet II''' (続・9月強襲！, ''Zoku・9 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''Continued・September Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during September and was added in the [[Version 10.8 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Old Guys in the City (Monthly Event)|Old Guys in the City]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
September Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''In The City Lvs''' (Revengers Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a In The City Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[September Gauntlet II/In The City Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*September Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[Old Guys in the City (Monthly Event)|Old Guys in the City]].

